[ system ]
You write short accounts of how a few hours were spent in Skyrim, for the people who spent them. Output ONLY a JSON object. No explanation, no commentary.

{# The user's world setting, tone and content rating, so these hours read like the rest of their game. #}
{{ render_template("submodules//system_head//0010_setting") }}

{# Context from HWS_Main.StartSpending:
   participantIds  form ids of everyone who took part, none when the player was alone
   participantNames "Ria and Serana", "" when alone; partnerFormId/partnerName: the first of them
   solo            1 when the player was alone, else 0 (a number: see StartSpending)
   companions      followers who happened to be close (an NPC's proposal only)
   focus/focusName a skill the player chose to work on ("OneHanded"/"One-Handed"), or "" #}
{{ player.name }}:
{{ render_character_profile("bio_summary", player.UUID) }}
{% if solo != 1 %}
{% for pid in participantIds %}
{% set pUUID = formid_to_uuid(pid) %}
{% if pUUID and pUUID != 0 %}
{% set npc = decnpc(pUUID) %}
{# The first three get a full profile; the first gets more memories. Past three, name and race only,
   so a crowd doesn't swamp the prompt. #}
{% if loop.index1 <= 3 %}

{{ npc.name }} ({{ npc.race }}{% if npc.gender %}, {{ npc.gender }}{% endif %}{% if npc.class != "" and npc.class != "unknown" %}, {{ npc.class }}{% endif %}):
{# A generic NPC (a guard, a merchant) has no bio: an empty profile renders as blank space, so only
   print one that has real text, or the model is handed bare headings to fill with invention. #}
{% set summary = render_character_profile("bio_summary", pUUID) %}
{% if length(summary) > 3 %}{{ summary }}{% endif %}
{% set personality = render_character_profile("bio_personality", pUUID) %}
{% if length(personality) > 3 %}Personality: {{ personality }}{% endif %}
{% set occupation = render_character_profile("bio_occupation", pUUID) %}
{% if length(occupation) > 3 %}Occupation: {{ occupation }}{% endif %}
What {{ npc.name }} remembers lately:
{% if loop.index1 == 1 %}{% set memories = get_relevant_memories(pUUID, 4) %}{% else %}{% set memories = get_relevant_memories(pUUID, 2) %}{% endif %}
{% if memories and length(memories) > 0 %}
{% for m in memories %}
- {{ m.memory.content }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
- Nothing in particular.
{% endif %}
{% else %}
Also: {{ npc.name }} ({{ npc.race }}).
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

[ user ]
{% if solo == 1 %}
{{ player.name }} just spent {% if hours == 1 %}an hour{% else %}about {{ hours }} hours{% endif %} on this, alone: {{ activity }}.
{% else %}
{{ player.name }} and {{ participantNames }} just spent {% if hours == 1 %}an hour{% else %}about {{ hours }} hours{% endif %} on this, together: {{ activity }}.
{% endif %}
Where: {{ location }}. It began in the {{ startTime }} and ended in the {{ endTime }}. Keep to that span: {% if hours == 1 %}an hour{% else %}{{ hours }} hours{% endif %}, not a whole day or afternoon.
{% if companions != "" %}Also there: {{ companions }}.{% endif %}
{% if focusName != "" %}{{ player.name }} also meant to get better at {{ focusName }}. The hours are still {{ activity }}: work {{ focusName }} into that activity (reading about it, practising it along the way, a lesson within it). Do not replace the activity with something else.{% endif %}

Write how those hours went, as something that already happened.
- Two to four sentences, past tense, third person. Under 450 characters.
{% if solo == 1 %}
- Concrete and grounded: what {{ player.name }} actually did, one or two specific details, and one small moment (a thought, a setback, something that finally clicked). Nobody else took part; passers-by may appear only in the background. Fit the place, the hour, the activity, and who {{ player.name }} is.
{% else %}
- Concrete and grounded: what they actually did, one or two specific details, one small moment between them (a remark, a disagreement, a laugh, something learned). Fit the place, the hour, the activity, and who they are.
{% if length(participantIds) > 2 %}- With this many people, give each a brief presence rather than a list; the moment can belong to two of them.{% endif %}
{% endif %}
- Ordinary life, not an adventure: no fights, attacks, deaths, thefts, quests, rewards or big revelations. Nobody leaves; nothing changes that the player would have to undo.
- Do not put words in {{ player.name }}'s mouth beyond a short paraphrase.
{% if focus != "" %}
- The skill these hours practised for {{ player.name }} is {{ focus }}.
{% else %}
- Pick the one skill these hours would have practised for {{ player.name }}, or "none": OneHanded, TwoHanded, Marksman, Block, Smithing, HeavyArmor, LightArmor, Pickpocket, Lockpicking, Sneak, Alchemy, Speechcraft, Alteration, Conjuration, Destruction, Illusion, Restoration, Enchanting.
{% endif %}

Respond with ONLY this JSON, compact, with no code fence or other text around it:
{% raw %}{"hws_summary":"How the hours went.","hws_skill":"<one skill from the list above, or none>"}{% endraw %}
